Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.40,0:00:02.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(贝库塔)你想去哪？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.68,0:00:06.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你知道 No.们在哪了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.75,0:00:08.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(千尊主)啊啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.61,0:00:10.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就在你记忆的深处。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.86,0:00:13.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的记忆？什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.19,0:00:16.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(千尊主)你闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.18,0:00:17.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}照我说的做就行了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.27,0:00:22.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过 在找 No.们之前{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}先找出那家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.09,0:00:23.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.26,0:00:29.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(星光)异次元飞行船{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.77,0:00:31.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正指示着第二个 No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.21,0:00:31.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所在的地方。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.47,0:00:33.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)哦哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.40,0:00:35.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)下一个目的地是孤岛的遗迹吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.38,0:00:37.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(璃绪)这次又有什么样的陷阱……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.94,0:00:39.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)会不会又有异晶人呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.05,0:00:41.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼 正合我意！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.58,0:00:45.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！ 冲吧游马号！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.94,0:00:46.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}尤玛号？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.23,0:00:48.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么时候起了这个名字？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.22,0:00:50.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘛 无所谓啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.67,0:00:53.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}命名品味真是零呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.43,0:00:59.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}帕克议员！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.53,0:01:00.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}帕克议员！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.22,0:01:02.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}非常感谢！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.96,0:01:03.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}帕克议员！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.41,0:01:05.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}帕克议员
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.98,0:01:06.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这次{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.74,0:01:08.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对于孩子们图书馆设立
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.59,0:01:10.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}的大额捐款 表示感谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.84,0:01:11.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(帕克)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.38,0:01:12.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没什么大不了的。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.95,0:01:15.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}孩子们是世界的宝物。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.54,0:01:19.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}前几天的儿童中心设立也是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.78,0:01:22.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}帕克议员真是太棒了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.57,0:01:25.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总是为了拯救那些不幸的人们提供支援。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.17,0:01:28.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把市民的生活放在第一位考虑。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.59,0:01:39.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}老大，这是昨晚的进账。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.18,0:01:42.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还有，今晚那帮家伙会带着货来港口。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.42,0:01:44.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明白了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.22,0:01:49.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}货全部拿下{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一个活口都不许留。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.96,0:01:51.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}OK，老大。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.44,0:01:58.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(真月)原来如此……表面上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.86,0:02:01.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是个热心慈善事业的政治家。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.65,0:02:03.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}剥下这层皮，就是地下赌场加走私。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.09,0:02:07.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么买卖都做的黑街老大。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.48,0:02:10.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是了不起的两面派。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.65,0:02:12.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么人，你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.14,0:02:21.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}差不多该请你的本体登场了吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.71,0:02:25.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}记得你这家伙是和九十九游马在一起的……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.56,0:02:35.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(No.96)你是什么人？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.83,0:02:37.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可能是普通人类。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.39,0:02:41.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一直在找你，No.96。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.43,0:02:45.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我是巴利安七皇之一，贝库塔。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.91,0:02:47.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望您能让我成为您的部下。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.31,0:02:49.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙真是个极品。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.09,0:02:53.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巴利安的你，居然要做我小弟。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.94,0:02:56.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}您才是应当成为真正王者的人。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.01,0:02:59.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我愿成为您的一大助力。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.34,0:03:01.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的目的是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.56,0:03:03.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵，只要利害一致{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.30,0:03:07.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}依附于强者之下是理所当然的事。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.03,0:03:10.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说我和你的利害一致？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.20,0:03:13.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}您应该并没有
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.40,0:03:16.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拯救星光界这种想法。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.22,0:03:19.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但也没有拯救巴利安界的意思。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.52,0:03:22.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果我说这一点也和我想法相同呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.88,0:03:23.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦……。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.11,0:03:27.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}作为忠诚的证明，我就告诉您新的 No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.81,0:03:29.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在哪里吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.38,0:03:31.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}新的 No.？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.00,0:03:35.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这应该不是什么坏事。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.36,0:03:37.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是异晶人的升级魔法卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.33,0:03:40.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你要把异晶人的力量献给我？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.04,0:03:43.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真正的王必须是无敌的。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.27,0:03:48.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好吧。我就听你的。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.95,0:03:55.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}借用这个男人的身体{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.24,0:03:57.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所谓的人类世界
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.61,0:03:58.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一直在观察{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.82,0:04:00.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也差不多腻了。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.58,0:04:06.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧，我的仆从。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.80,0:05:49.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦，哇啊～！好痛！好痛痛！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.25,0:05:51.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，叫你坐好嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.85,0:05:53.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(璃绪)外面情况很不妙呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.54,0:05:57.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来异次元内很大范围内{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.32,0:05:59.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}空间的扭曲似乎正在发生。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.18,0:06:04.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)真是个忙不停的家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.71,0:06:07.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《且不说这异次元内的异变{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.49,0:06:10.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还有之前感受到的那股异样的气息{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.83,0:06:12.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底发生了什么…》
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.21,0:06:24.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这里 新的 No.卡…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.32,0:06:32.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《怎么回事！？这种不爽的感觉。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.47,0:06:35.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}简直就像全身的毛都竖起来了一样…》
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.47,0:06:38.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你在笑什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.76,0:06:42.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来你果然能感觉到啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.37,0:06:45.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙 知道些什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.87,0:06:47.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在没必要知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.30,0:06:48.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.16,0:06:52.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}比起那个 把那张 No.卡96
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.74,0:06:54.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吸收进你体内{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.86,0:06:56.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后加以利用。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.59,0:07:00.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《我知道迟早会找机会的》
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.32,0:07:00.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.55,0:07:05.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不，没什么。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.91,0:07:14.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是让人舒服的气息啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.48,0:07:19.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我听得见啊，跨越时空呐喊的人类怨念的悲鸣。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.39,0:07:21.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怨念……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.62,0:07:22.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}人类这种东西{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.25,0:07:26.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是不断累积怨恨与伪善从而创造历史的生物。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.92,0:07:29.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是愚蠢的东西啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.55,0:07:33.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么，该往哪边前进呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.30,0:07:45.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦？看来之前来过这里啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.04,0:07:46.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.60,0:07:49.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}身体自己就……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.55,0:07:59.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦哦！那就是有 No.的遗迹吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.92,0:08:08.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这里就是入口吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.15,0:08:12.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这里……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.11,0:08:14.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}相当不妙啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.51,0:08:16.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呀、呀咩，太糟了吧！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.74,0:08:19.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以的话，进去这事还是别去比较好。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.15,0:08:22.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，地图上显示的就是这里。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.30,0:08:24.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是……是这样呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.02,0:08:30.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总觉得，好吓人啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.10,0:08:32.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这面墙……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.86,0:08:37.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是这座遗迹的传说吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.46,0:08:39.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在互相哀叹着呢……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.72,0:08:42.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}过去的人们。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.67,0:08:46.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}过、过去的人？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.67,0:08:49.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别、别说了啦，总觉得好可怕。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.54,0:08:51.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超越时间的生命能量
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.45,0:08:53.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在向我们诉说。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.00,0:08:58.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被诅咒的王宫传说。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.59,0:09:03.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}曾经住在这座王宫里统治岛屿的王子。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.34,0:09:07.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自幼便不信任人心{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.45,0:09:11.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对所有人投以怀疑的目光，并加以裁决。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.63,0:09:16.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}夺走所有人的性命之后{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.80,0:09:20.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}仅剩王子一人 自绝性命。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.75,0:09:22.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被诅咒的传说…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.58,0:09:26.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃绪！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.17,0:09:29.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没事。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.81,0:09:32.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《岛上几乎所有的生命都被夺走了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.63,0:09:35.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}统治岛屿的王子》
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.22,0:09:38.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被诅咒的…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.77,0:09:40.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}王宫…。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.45,0:09:48.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(真月)这里是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.04,0:09:56.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来是执行刑罚的广场啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.71,0:10:00.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这里有相当数量的人命被夺走了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.10,0:10:02.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.06,0:10:03.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这种近似恐惧的感情》
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.31,0:10:10.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来了吗 游马 星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.43,0:10:11.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来是的。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.34,0:10:13.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么我来{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.19,0:10:14.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就在这里 把他们
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.55,0:10:16.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打下地狱去吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.55,0:10:17.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}开什么玩笑！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.40,0:10:19.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九游马由我来… 唔。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.88,0:10:22.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((咚·千：你的出场顺序在后面))
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.70,0:10:25.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《什、什么。 那是…》
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.64,0:10:28.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但在那之前 得先把 No.卡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.67,0:10:30.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拿到手才行啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.31,0:10:44.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.29,0:10:57.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙就是守护 No.卡的人吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.38,0:11:05.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有意思。 你和我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.44,0:11:08.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是要来试试谁更强吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.57,0:11:14.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}热血沸腾啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.34,0:11:17.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.28,0:11:25.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}该往哪边走才好呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.32,0:11:31.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那边有标记。 这边。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.08,0:11:32.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等等游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.96,0:11:34.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等一下。 可能是陷阱也说不定哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.02,0:11:37.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没事。 交给我吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.20,0:11:46.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么回事？刚才那声音。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.29,0:11:52.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}骗人！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.49,0:11:53.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.83,0:11:59.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那到底是什么啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.68,0:12:04.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有标记。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.24,0:12:14.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}千钧一发。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.80,0:12:16.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂，游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.58,0:12:19.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你刚走上选的那条路，陷阱就发动了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.00,0:12:22.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}惊险度满分吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.84,0:12:25.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过，那个标记到底是谁弄的？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.83,0:12:26.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一定是老爸。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.63,0:12:28.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马的爸爸？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.39,0:12:31.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯，就是那个老爸。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.83,0:12:35.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在最容易避开的陷阱通道上做了标记。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.58,0:12:36.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真不愧是呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.16,0:12:38.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎呀～ 都不好意思了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.32,0:12:41.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}又不是在夸你。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.57,0:12:53.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.96,0:12:59.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊～ 好痛。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.31,0:13:00.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.19,0:13:01.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这里是？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.32,0:13:05.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什、什么？牢房？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.52,0:13:06.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂，游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.66,0:13:07.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.99,0:13:09.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家都没事吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.29,0:13:10.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.40,0:13:12.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这里是哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.08,0:13:15.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来是中了陷阱呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.19,0:13:19.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哟，好久不见了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.54,0:13:21.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马君。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.44,0:13:24.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你、你是贝库塔！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.72,0:13:26.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎呀哎呀，真让人寂寞啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.14,0:13:30.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已经不再叫我真月了吗，游马君。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.57,0:13:32.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.96,0:13:35.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}刚把你请来就告诉你个坏消息。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.67,0:13:37.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.已经到手了。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.52,0:13:38.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.56,0:13:41.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然你都特意来了就这样也太没意思了。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.80,0:13:43.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么样？拿 No.来赌
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.69,0:13:44.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来场决斗吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.20,0:13:47.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好啊。我接受挑战。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.02,0:13:55.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么游马，就请你移步到特别室去吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.45,0:14:01.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.11,0:14:06.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是什么鬼！？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.23,0:14:12.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那里啊，不用这个装置解开机关的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.40,0:14:13.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就出不来！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.06,0:14:16.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从 No.那里，我得到了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.80,0:14:18.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}各种关于这里机关的情报。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.19,0:14:21.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}关于这个悲鸣迷宫的机关。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.73,0:14:24.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}开什么玩笑！待在这种地方
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.71,0:14:26.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么可能决斗啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.66,0:14:30.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别慌。要决斗的，不是你。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.57,0:14:31.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.91,0:14:33.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体！？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.04,0:14:36.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一定是 在盘算着什么不好的事情呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.35,0:14:40.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂喂那家伙是我的决斗对手啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.78,0:14:41.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.81,0:14:43.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.77,0:14:48.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场决斗 由我来接。下来吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.63,0:14:53.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}很遗憾你的对手不是我 星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.56,0:14:58.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙是！？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.41,0:14:59.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.96！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.41,0:15:01.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好久不见了 星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.34,0:15:05.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这里的话 就算是我们也能尽情地决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.21,0:15:08.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.就在这儿。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.18,0:15:10.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那张卡是……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.25,0:15:12.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道 你和巴利安联手了？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.77,0:15:15.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是对方擅自缠上来的伸出的手{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.60,0:15:17.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我只是温柔地握住了而已。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.86,0:15:20.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我说过吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.82,0:15:22.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总有一天要得到你的身体。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.47,0:15:25.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在就来兑现这句话。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.73,0:15:29.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在决斗中打败你！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.41,0:15:32.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗盘 设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.91,0:15:37.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 你的卡牌我借来用用。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.91,0:15:42.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧～！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.98,0:15:48.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让你好好领教一下。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.81,0:15:53.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和以前战斗时的我已经不一样了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.30,0:15:55.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(两人)决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.49,0:15:59.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.86,0:16:02.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤 马里斯波拉斯之匙！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.93,0:16:10.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再将手牌中的马里斯波拉斯之刃送去墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.88,0:16:13.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤 马里斯波拉斯之叉！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.61,0:16:14.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.25,0:16:16.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将1只马里斯波拉斯怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.82,0:16:18.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从手牌送去墓地
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.56,0:16:19.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.20,0:16:23.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 发动马里斯波拉斯之匙的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.07,0:16:25.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙 1回合1次{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.97,0:16:27.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}马里斯波拉斯怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.71,0:16:29.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被特殊召唤时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.30,0:16:30.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以从墓地 将等级2以下的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.94,0:16:33.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}马里斯波拉斯怪兽特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.14,0:16:35.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 马里斯波拉斯之刃！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.62,0:16:41.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级2的怪兽 一口气3只。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.02,0:16:44.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用 等级2的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.27,0:16:48.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}马里斯波拉斯之匙 之刃、之叉进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.94,0:16:50.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}3只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.35,0:16:52.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.18,0:16:54.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.33,0:16:59.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 我的分身 No.96！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.07,0:17:04.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来自漆黑之暗的使者黑雾！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.57,0:17:06.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}黑雾！？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.05,0:17:09.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}黑雾在战斗时
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.24,0:17:11.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用1个超量单位{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.03,0:17:14.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对方1只怪兽的攻击力减半{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.15,0:17:17.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并将减少的数值加到攻击力上。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.59,0:17:19.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说 不管什么样的敌人{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.24,0:17:22.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}黑雾都能通过这个效果
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.07,0:17:24.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}比对方高出100点攻击力。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.08,0:17:25.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.84,0:17:27.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谁都不可能打赢。 呵呵呵…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.31,0:17:33.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放1张卡 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.24,0:17:37.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.17,0:17:40.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌特殊召唤 夜骑士。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.55,0:17:42.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.21,0:17:44.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在自己场上没有怪兽的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.68,0:17:47.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以从手牌特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.02,0:17:53.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且我再通常召唤 夜骑士。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.22,0:18:00.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}4星怪兽有2只…。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.68,0:18:04.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光难道说 你打算召唤「霍普」吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.20,0:18:07.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼 你以为这种程度的计策
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.84,0:18:09.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我会看不穿吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.16,0:18:12.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你召唤两只「拟声乌托邦」的目的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.54,0:18:14.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并不是为了召唤「霍普」{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.93,0:18:17.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而是想让两只「拟声乌托邦」对「黑雾」
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.49,0:18:19.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用「叠放单位」吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.50,0:18:22.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用那只攻击力低的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.81,0:18:26.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把对自己造成的伤害控制在最小限度。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.54,0:18:31.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}永续陷阱「小停战」发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.74,0:18:33.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}根据这个效果 场上的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.62,0:18:35.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力1000以下的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.96,0:18:36.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无法攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.30,0:18:41.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 攻击表示的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.82,0:18:43.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没有攻击的场合{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.83,0:18:44.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在回合结束时
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.87,0:18:47.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}受到1000点伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.17,0:18:47.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.68,0:18:50.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不仅「深夜骑士」的攻击被封锁了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.79,0:18:51.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}「星辉士」
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.38,0:18:53.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还要承受1000点伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.49,0:18:57.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用两只等级4的「深夜骑士」叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.88,0:19:01.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用两只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.14,0:19:03.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.87,0:19:05.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.50,0:19:10.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}出来吧，「No.39」！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.90,0:19:12.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇 霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.13,0:19:17.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（希望皇 霍普）霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.83,0:19:22.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为「深夜骑士」的攻击被封锁了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.56,0:19:24.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以召唤了霍普吗……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.28,0:19:26.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}靠霍普可赢不了「黑雾」！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.81,0:19:28.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你打算怎么办，星辉士！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.60,0:19:33.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，你觉得我会毫无对策地召唤霍普吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.59,0:19:35.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.64,0:19:36.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.45,0:19:39.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动装备魔法「置换守护长袍」。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.55,0:19:42.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}由于这张卡的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.07,0:19:45.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇的攻击力上升500点。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.61,0:19:48.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用希望皇攻击黑雾！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.53,0:19:51.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}黑雾的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.77,0:19:53.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用一个超量素材
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.80,0:19:56.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对方怪兽的攻击力减半。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.90,0:19:58.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并将那个数值
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.07,0:20:00.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}加到黑雾的攻击力上。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.39,0:20:02.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}暗影增益！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.09,0:20:14.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样下去希望皇会被干掉的！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.57,0:20:17.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真遗憾啊 星光！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.54,0:20:18.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那可不一定？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.85,0:20:19.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.64,0:20:22.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就在这一刻 交换守护长袍的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.31,0:20:23.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}更进一步的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.18,0:20:26.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备怪兽的攻击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.27,0:20:28.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因这张卡以外的效果发生变化时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.33,0:20:31.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以将变化的那部分数值的伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.73,0:20:33.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给予对方玩家。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.69,0:20:39.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 你受到的伤害就是1500！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.62,0:20:43.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来如此。把黑雾的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.86,0:20:45.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}反过来利用了是吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.88,0:21:00.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再使用一张希望皇霍普的叠放单位{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.50,0:21:03.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让这场战斗无效化。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.94,0:21:05.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好耶～！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.87,0:21:07.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}先制攻击成功了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.82,0:21:09.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真不愧是你。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.25,0:21:13.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 你觉得我会白白挨下这伤害吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.88,0:21:14.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.25,0:21:17.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.18,0:21:22.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.24,0:21:25.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底怎么回事！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.55,0:21:27.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 忘了说了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.03,0:21:29.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.96的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.27,0:21:31.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}生命值每减少一次{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.90,0:21:35.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这座悲鸣迷宫的机关就会启动一个。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.31,0:21:37.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么 你说什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.46,0:21:42.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶——！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.66,0:21:44.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这么说来 星光体在这场决斗中……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.16,0:21:47.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是无法攻击的咯。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.15,0:21:48.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)卑鄙！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.32,0:21:50.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的手里 可不只有
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.05,0:21:51.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}牌组里的卡而已。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.41,0:21:54.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}悲鸣迷宫会封住你的行动
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.81,0:21:57.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以说是永续陷阱吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.95,0:22:01.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么 你打算怎么办？星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.47,0:23:43.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.58,0:23:46.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.93,0:23:50.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.70,0:23:53.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.51,0:23:55.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.23,0:23:56.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.40,0:23:59.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
